Description:
Google's fork of OpenSSL designed for Chromium, Android, Bun (`boringssl_sys`), Electron,
and `wreq-util` (Chrome JA3/JA4 TLS & Post-Quantum X25519MLKEM768 emulation).

Local Modifications:
Shared ABI symbols verified across Bun `boringssl_sys`, `wreq-util`, and Electron/Node crypto.
